{"id":"8756810b413a47d8","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-uniform-matrix.md","title":"类的 oracle 统一与子统一枚举","display":"df-uniform-matrix — 类的 oracle 统一与子统一枚举","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-uniform-matrix","aliases":["20-df-uniform-matrix"],"display":"df-uniform-matrix — 类的 oracle 统一与子统一枚举","chapter":"4","section":"4.8","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 4.8.1","source_printed_pages":[100],"source_pdf_pages":[136],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-uniform-matrix"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-uniform-matrix</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-uniform-matrix — 类的 oracle 统一与子统一枚举"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.8"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 4.8.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>100</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>136</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x\\in\\omega\">\\(e,x\\in\\omega\\)</span>。行运算对下述被量化的矩阵逐个定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}matrix}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{row}(f,e):=\\{(x,f(x,e)):x\\in\\omega\\},\\qquad f_e:=\\operatorname{row}(f,e)\n\\quad(f\\in\\omega^{\\omega^2},\\ e\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Uniform}_A(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_2^A\\ [\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^2\\land\n\\mathcal F=\\{\\operatorname{row}(f,e):e\\in\\omega\\}],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Subuniform}_A(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_2^A\\ [\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^2\\land\n\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\{\\operatorname{row}(f,e):e\\in\\omega\\}].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}matrix}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{row}(f,e):=\\{(x,f(x,e)):x\\in\\omega\\},\\qquad f_e:=\\operatorname{row}(f,e)\n\\quad(f\\in\\omega^{\\omega^2},\\ e\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Uniform}_A(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_2^A\\ [\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^2\\land\n\\mathcal F=\\{\\operatorname{row}(f,e):e\\in\\omega\\}],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Subuniform}_A(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_2^A\\ [\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^2\\land\n\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\{\\operatorname{row}(f,e):e\\in\\omega\\}].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>行参数位于第二个坐标，与书中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_y=\\lambda x[f(x,y)]\">\\(f_y=\\lambda x[f(x,y)]\\)</span> 一致。统一枚举的每行必须属于指定类；子统一枚举允许额外行。这里比较的是函数外延，允许重复行，不是枚举可计算函数的程序索引。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 4.8.1；印刷页 100；PDF 第 136 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"e,x\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}matrix}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{row}(f,e):=\\{(x,f(x,e)):x\\in\\omega\\},\\qquad f_e:=\\operatorname{row}(f,e)\n\\quad(f\\in\\omega^{\\omega^2},\\ e\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Uniform}_A(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_2^A\\ [\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^2\\land\n\\mathcal F=\\{\\operatorname{row}(f,e):e\\in\\omega\\}],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Subuniform}_A(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_2^A\\ [\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^2\\land\n\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\{\\operatorname{row}(f,e):e\\in\\omega\\}].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"f_y=\\lambda x[f(x,y)]","display":false}],"bytes":1749,"backlinks":[{"id":"bd644b6a31616fc0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-jump]]。"},{"id":"3356f7f8d1c48a51","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-low-basis]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。"},{"id":"fc88f329ff785b03","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；see [[20-thm-martin-high]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。"},{"id":"d83faf50f3b30d4d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；see [[20-thm-high-function-enumeration]]；see [[20-thm-martin-high]]；see [[20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus]]。"},{"id":"47dda3af2234de34","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；see [[20-thm-low2-domination]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-uniform-matrix]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-233","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-uniform-matrix]] — 章 4；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-233","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-uniform-matrix]]"},{"id":"15cf85fd84eaf3f9","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"重点入口：编码与模型 [[20-df-strings]]、[[20-df-t